        "comments": "The assembly csSphPalu1.2 is based on 30x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The genome is tetraploid so this assembly represents one copy of each chromosome from each sub genome. This includes a single copy of a putative sex chromosome and multiple copies of a michrochromosome which appears to be underrepresented based on read coverage.",
